==Overview==
The '''Zombie Toilet''' is a [[Mythic]] [[Units|unit]] that has a 0.1% (0.2 with 2x gamepass or luck boost, and 0.3 with both), 1.5% in [[Mythic Crate]] (3% with Luck boost, 4.5% with gamepass and boosts.) chance being summoned while in rotation from the [[Summoning|Main Summoning Area]]. It takes approximately 21600 coins ([[Mythic Crate]]) and a ton of grinding, unless the player purchases coins with Robux or is lucky. Its amount of single target and AOE damage, and value have soared drastically.  It was released in the [[Speed Run Update]] and reworked in the [[Season 2 Update]]. It is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet-zombie-universe.fandom.com/wiki/Normal_Skibidi_Toilet Zombie Skibidi Toilet] from MonsterUP's zombie universe series.

== Obtainment==
'''Zombie Toilet''' can be obtained from the [[File:Basic crate.png|40px|link=https://toilet-tower-defense-game.fandom.com/wiki/Basic_Crate]] {{Basic|Basic Crate|}} with a 0.1% chance (0.2% with luck boost/gamepass, or 0.4% with both), or from the [[File:New icon.png|40px|link=https://toilet-tower-defense-game.fandom.com/wiki/Mythic_Crate]] {{Mythic|Mythic Crate|}} with a 1.5% chance (3% with luck boost/gamepass, or 4.5% with both).

You can additionally get it from trading, get it as a gift at the [[Post Office]] or buy it for gems on the [[Marketplace]].

