==Strategy ==

*Place it down in large places or crowded areas to maximize its range.
*Place the unit close to high DPS troops that cannot slow down enemies like [[Hyper Upgraded Titan Speakerman|'''Hyper Upgraded Titan Speakerman''']], so that the '''Zombie Toilet''' can become a good support unit.
*Put it near units that hit a multitude of enemies or have spread because it bunches them up with the slowing if on target first.
*Use this as an [[Astro Upgraded Titan Cameraman|'''Astro Upgraded Titan Cameraman''']] alternative since they both do slowing, but '''Zombie Toilet''' has less slowing range.

==Trivia==

*This unit is a better version of '''[[Bald Toilet]]''' even though Zombie Toilet does less DPS, but '''Zombie Toilet''' slows, and '''Zombie Toilet''' is cheaper to max out.
*This unit is one of the first units that was added from the [https://skibidi-toilet-zombie-universe.fandom.com/wiki/Skibidi_toilet_zombie_universe_Wiki Zombie Universe Series]. (Second if [[Zombie Horde Cameraman]] counts).
*This unit is an alternative to [[The Golden Skibidi]] because they both do 360'''°''' AoE 60% slowing but has slightly less DPS, F2P, no stunning abilities, and less stun blocks.
*This unit replaced all [[Mythic|Mythics]] such as [[Mace Camerawoman]], [[Knife Upgraded Titan Speakerman]] and others from the [[Basic Crate]] and [[Mythic]]

